c.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183500/extras/7c934a1928404ad8f1452c09bf1a3c9b.webp?t=1737097264\" width=615 height=56 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183500/extras/aa5018590fb56f5e3be71afe48ae3d78.poster.avif?t=1737097264\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183500/extras/aa5018590fb56f5e3be71afe48ae3d78.webm?t=1737097264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183500/extras/aa5018590fb56f5e3be71afe48ae3d78.mp4?t=1737097264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>A newborn civilization always has to face the test of times, not to mention that this is a world surrounded by powerful enemies. You will find the way to develop under the crisis and try to guard your civilization from eight batches of powerful attacks. With a variety of difficulty levels, you'll be challenged to complete an ever-escalating level! </strong>",
